ICH ICSR XML schemas (HL7)
  The ICH ICSR XML Schema Set includes HL7 v3 core schemas, which are
  third-party content. e2br3 does NOT bundle or redistribute these schemas.
  Users fetch them from the official source (scripts/fetch_fixtures.py) and
  pass their location to validate().

